### List Appointments by Patient Email (the address in the body, never in the URL)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/lookup/appointment/patient/email
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{
  "email": "minor1@example.com"
}

### List Appointments by Patient Phone (the number in the body, never in the URL)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/lookup/appointment/patient/phone
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{
  "phone": "0700000011"
}

### List Appointments by Patient MRN (the MRN in the body, never in the URL)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/lookup/appointment/patient/mrn
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mrn": "{mrn}"
}

### List Appointments by Staff Number
GET http://localhost:8081/api/lookup/appointment/staff/number/{number}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: en

### List Appointments by Staff Email (the address in the body, never in the URL)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/lookup/appointment/staff/email
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{
  "email": "sandoff_doctor@hospital.com"
}

### List Appointments by Staff ID
GET http://localhost:8081/api/lookup/appointment/staff/id/bad141f5-8796-4196-9019-b242d7cbddea
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: en

### Book Appointment (by staff or patient, no IDs)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{
  "patientUsername": "minor_patient1",
  "staffEmail": "sandoff_doctor@hospital.com",
  "hospitalCode": "CSX-2F3DE",
  "departmentName": "Radiology",
  "appointmentDate": "2025-08-22",
  "startTime": "15:00:00",
  "endTime": "15:30:00",
  "notes": "Initial ultrasound"
}

### Reschedule Appointment
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/appointments/39613a7d-7978-4c4a-a7be-4a06a8456c9a
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{
  "patientId": "9bae259d-10ec-439a-8ff4-568a3ebcb1a2",
  "staffId": "bad141f5-8796-4196-9019-b242d7cbddea",
  "hospitalId": "8ecdb484-dbfa-4cc7-b622-a4baf942a357",
  "appointmentDate": "2025-08-22",
  "startTime": "17:00:00",
  "endTime": "17:30:00",
  "notes": "Rescheduled time"
}

### Cancel Appointment
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/appointments/39613a7d-7978-4c4a-a7be-4a06a8456c9a/status?action=cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: en

### Complete Appointment
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/appointments/b54fddc8-f98f-4f40-9192-c12f168e295d/status?action=complete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: en

### Mark as No-Show
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/appointments/{id}/status?action=no_show
Authorization: Bearer <JWT>

### Get Appointment by ID
GET http://localhost:8081/api/appointments/{id}
Authorization: Bearer <JWT>

### List All Appointments for User
GET http://localhost:8081/api/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: en

### Delete Appointment
DELETE http://localhost:8081/api/appointments/{id}
Authorization: Bearer <JWT>

### List by Patient (the username in the body, never in the URL)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/appointments/patients/by-username
Authorization: Bearer <JWT>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{patientUsername}"
}

### List by Staff
GET http://localhost:8081/api/appointments/staff/{staffId}
Authorization: Bearer <JWT>
